  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen country capacities in public health emergency preparedness, surveillance and response to priority diseases, conditions and events that include COVID-19. This will ensure improved implementation of routine surveillance, COVID-19 surveillance and response within the Integrated Disease Surveillance and Response system while maintaining the continuity of essential health service delivery.</narrative>
